ities with a variety of content, including real-world, virtual, and AI-generated experiences\u2014making every moment a delightful surprise.\nStart your journey with LivePortal today and step into a world of infinite possibilities!", "short_description": "LivePortal is a cutting-edge spatial video MR application that delivers a true sense of spatial immersion and offers a wide variety of captivating content."}]}, "developer_name": "SuperMorning", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/liveportal-en", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KevinSheep", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/liveportal-main", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24270237389234424"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "9289020551160225"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "9289020551160225"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1738207620, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "9289020551160225"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28690063423918443", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "1052381675930819", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__t